# Frontend — Next.js & React

Skill: [.cursor/skills/frontend-feature/SKILL.md](../skills/frontend-feature/SKILL.md) · Live UI: `app/(app)` + `components/` (Synapse). Legacy archive: root `old/frontend` (do not import).

## Component skeleton

```tsx
'use client';

import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { useAuth } from '@/contexts/AuthContext';
import { usePermissions } from '@/contexts/PermissionsContext';
import { getApiUrl } from '@/lib/api/config';
import ConfirmAlertModal from '@/components/ConfirmAlertModal';

export default function PageName() {
  const { user, token } = useAuth();
  const { permissions } = usePermissions();
  const [dialog, setDialog] = useState<{ type: 'confirm' | 'alert'; title: string; message: string; onConfirm?: () => void } | null>(null);

  return (
    <div className="w-full">
      {/* content */}
      <ConfirmAlertModal
        isOpen={!!dialog}
        type={dialog?.type || 'alert'}
        title={dialog?.title || ''}
        message={dialog?.message || ''}
        onClose={() => setDialog(null)}
        onConfirm={() => { dialog?.onConfirm?.(); setDialog(null); }}
        confirmLabel="Delete"
        confirmVariant="danger"
      />
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Layout

- Pages: **`w-full`** wrapper — never add `container` / `max-w-*` outer shell unless user asks.
- Dark mode on every new element: pair light/dark classes.
- `'use client'` only when using hooks, events, or browser APIs.

## API calls

```typescript
const res = await fetch(`${getApiUrl()}/api/endpoint`, {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: {
    Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,
    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
  },
  body: JSON.stringify(payload),
});
if (!res.ok) {
  const err = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
  throw new Error(err.message || 'Request failed');
}
```

- Prefer existing clients in `lib/api/*.ts` when present.
- Always handle loading + error UI states.

## Dialogs (mandatory)

- **Never** `alert()`, `confirm()`, `window.confirm()`.
- Use [`ConfirmAlertModal`](../../components/ConfirmAlertModal.tsx): `type: 'alert' | 'confirm'`.
- Pattern: `app/projects/page.tsx` — `modalMessage` state + single modal at page bottom.

## Tables / grids (Applications list standard)

Shell:

```html
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
  <table>
    <thead class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">...</thead>
  </table>
</div>
```

Actions column:

- Header: `<span class="sr-only">Actions</span>` only — no visible "Actions" text.
- Buttons: icon-only SVG, `p-1.5 text-gray-400 rounded`, blue hover edit / red hover delete.
- `title` + `aria-label` on every icon button.
- Gate each action with `permissions?.canXxx`.

Toolbar buttons (Import / Export / New): `h-10 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center`.

## Permissions UI

```tsx
const { permissions, isLoading } = usePermissions();
if (isLoading) return null;
{permissions?.canCreateTasks && <button>...</button>}
```

- Hide/disable actions user cannot perform; **backend still validates**.

## Time display

- Always **`hh:MM:ss`** via local `decimalHoursToHMS(hours: number)`.
- Minutes → hours: `decimalHoursToHMS(minutes / 60)`.
- Never show `1.5h` or raw decimals in UI totals.

## Hours aggregation (UI)

- **Totals / estimated / worked hours**: sum **leaf tasks only** (exclude parents that have children).
- **Task counts**: include all tasks + subtasks.

## Large pages

- `app/planning/page.tsx` is ~12k lines — **extract hooks** (e.g. `app/planning/hooks/`) instead of growing the monolith.
- Example extracted helper: `loadOutlookCalendarEvents.ts`.

## Customer / portal users

- `CustomerUserGuard` where appropriate.
- Customer ticket create: no project picker; send `projectId: null`.

## KPI dashboard

- List-backed widgets: same source as drill-down (`detailsByWidget`).
- Row click: tasks/time → `TaskDetailModal`; projects/customers/tickets → navigate to detail page.
